**Definition 2.9.1.** $`(\mathfrak{g}, [\ ,\ ])` is a **Lie algebra** if $`[\ ,\ ]` satisfies the Jacobi identity

$$`(2.9.1) \qquad [[a, b], c] + [[b, c], a] + [[c, a], b] = 0.`
